  "invalid_records_description": "Each case applies set (each path set to value) and remove (each path deleted) to expected.record, then recomputes act_chain_hash, record_hash and the producer seal. The seal uses producer_private_jwk unless sealed_by names another producer, whose private_jwk seals it instead. An acts value of \"OBSERVED_ACTS_ONLY\" means the record's observed act alone, the second entry of expected.record.acts. The resealed record has resealed_record_hash and fails verification; rule names the rule it breaks. A case with schema_expresses false states a rule JSON Schema cannot express, so the \"0.3\" schema accepts that record and only the verifier refuses it.",
